cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cradle in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Cradle"
abstract: >-
  A modular cell-simulation platform in which data sources, simulation engines,
  and AI/foundation models are independently versioned, swappable components,
  designed for scientific traceability (MIRIAM annotation, MIASE-compliant
  provenance) rather than a fixed, monolithic model.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.0.0-phase0"
date-released: "2026-08-20"
